# Force binary handling for media assets so git's line-ending/encoding
# normalization (core.autocrlf) never touches their raw bytes. Without this,
# a binary file can get silently corrupted if it's ever misdetected as text.
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
